cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QECCertificates in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "QECCertificates: certified code parameters and fault distances"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 library and a certificate toolchain for quantum error correction: the
  GF(2) and symplectic machinery, an in-kernel checker for LRAT certificates, and a
  Python certificate chain that encodes distance lower bounds as CNF and checks the
  resulting proofs independently of any solver.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The QECCertificates Authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/QCL-SUAT/QECCertificates"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-30"
keywords:
  - quantum error correction
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
  - certificates
